      "text": "Time may pass, but valor endures.\n\nToday, we had the honor of welcoming 11 WWII veterans to New Orleans! The group of veterans, their guardians, and students traveled from Chicago O'Hare International Airport to visit the The National WWII Museum courtesy of the Gary Sinise Foundation. The veterans were greeted at the airport by the TSA Honor Guard, members of the Amelia Earhawts, members of the Coast Guard, the Honor Guard of the Covington VFW, airport staff and passengers before departing on their exciting trip in the city.",
